# BoBERT + CM2T2A (Bidirectional osu! Beatmap Encoder Representations from Transformers + Contrastive Map-Metadata-Tag-Topic Alignment)

## BoBERT
- Based on ModernBERT
- Tokens are formed by stacking features of hit objects that were passed through FT-Transformer-esque feature embedding layers

## CM2TA
- Utilizes a lightweight tabular transformer that encodes beatmap metadata, user tags and collection topics